             Dear {!Contact.FirstName},  <br /><br />

Your student ID card has been reported as lost or stolen. We have disabled your card to prevent any unauthorized purchases or building access.  <br /><br />

If you find your card, please email us at 
<a href="mailto:sundevilcardinfo@asu.edu" target="_blank">
 sundevilcardinfo@asu.edu</a> and we will re-enable your ID card. <br /><br />

If your card was stolen you may obtain a new card at no cost by bringing a valid police report to any one of the four Sun Card Office <a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/cardservices#fees-and-location" target="_blank">locations</a>.<br /><br />

If your card was lost, please visit the <a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/cardservices#replacement-cards" target="_blank">Replacement Card</a> section of our website for replacement options. <br /><br />

Regards,<br /><br />

 {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
